  "id": "ug",
  "term": "UG",
  "definition": "UG stands for the Ultimatum Game, an interactive decision-making task used to study fairness and inequity aversion. In it, people respond to offers that can be fair or unfair, and their acceptance or rejection behavior is used to examine how fairness preferences shape later cooperation.",
